{"id":"4756","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4756_main_cumulus-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>照片显示了积云的小碎片。由于在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处具有非常粗糙、模糊和不明显的边缘，因此可将其识别为碎云云种。云的形状和轮廓经历了持续变化，这种变化可以非常迅速。在远处，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处可以看到几个积云；边缘更明显，云底是水平的，而云的垂直范围小，外观扁平。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Amarbileg Shajbalidir","location":"蒙古赛音山达","latitude":"纬度: 44° 53' 58'' N","longitude":"经度: 110° 7' 42'' E","date":"27 October 2015 1104 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.4"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4980_main_cumulus-humilis-and-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>积云是独立的云，通常密集且具有清晰的轮廓，以上升的土墩、圆顶或塔楼的形式垂直发展，通常有明亮的白色阳光照射部分。在这张照片中，我们看到了两种积云云类。朝向图像的顶部（靠近相机），<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云呈现出凹凸不平的碎积云边缘</span>，其轮廓通常快速且不断地变化。这些很可能是积云发展的初始阶段。在远处，我们注意到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云有清晰的轮廓，垂直增长非常有限，看似扁平</span>；这可确定其为淡积云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Amran Rajabu Msonga","location":"坦桑尼亚联合共和国多多马","latitude":"纬度: 6° 12' 35'' S","longitude":"经度: 35° 45' 18'' E","date":"30 June 2016 1302 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.4 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.4 2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4983_main_cumulus-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这个图象显示在一个微风天，英国康沃尔郡海岸出现的小一片独立的积云。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处，云的边缘不规则且模糊，这将其确定为碎云云种。当远离太阳看时，就像在这种情况下，碎云具有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色外观</span>。碎云的形状和轮廓经历了非常迅速的连续变化。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国康沃尔郡波特瑞什","latitude":"纬度: 50° 15' 42'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 17' 24'' W","date":"09 August 2006 1438 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.4 2.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.4 2.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4992_main_cumulus-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这张照片显示了碎积云形成的初始阶段。它是水蒸气冷凝并几乎立即蒸发的极好例子。可以看到小水滴，其长度足以在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处呈现模糊的乳白色光泽。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处的两个小白点是云形成的第一个迹象；它可能是形成淡积云的开始。 </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Ger Breman","location":"荷兰埃尔堡","latitude":"纬度: 52° 26' 55'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 49' 54'' E","date":"30 June 2015 1059 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.4 1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.4 1.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5001_main_cumulis-humilis-and-cirrostratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在加勒比地区的东北信风区内，白天对流云停止后，出现了这种淡积云和碎云。1978年9月26日当地时间18：11，格林纳达格兰德安塞海滩。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"格林纳达","latitude":"纬度: 12° 0' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 61° 47' 46'' W","date":"26 September 1978 1811 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.1 20","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.1 20"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5183_main_cumulus-fractus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>图为仍在十分潮湿的后冷锋气流中形成积云的破裂小碎片。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>，云边缘破碎和发散，可确定为碎云种。积云的轮廓和形状在不断变化。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛，圣彼得，泽西机场","latitude":"纬度: 49° 12' 25'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 11' 51'' W","date":"30 May 2011 2057 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.4"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4325_main_cumulus-humilis-and-cumulus-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>这些云大多是典型的淡积云。它们具有清晰的水平底边，通常带有阴影；轮廓并非非常参差不齐，整体顶部较平坦，仅局部略有圆弧状。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处有一些碎积云。</p>\n<p>观测时的天空位于一个覆盖芬兰和瑞典的弱反气旋的西部区域。</p></div>","copyright":"© T. Bergeron","location":"Ånn, Sweden","latitude":"纬度: 63° 19' 32'' N","longitude":"经度: 12° 32' 5'' E","date":"14 July 1950 1000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}